  "description": "Monetra.Core is the foundational package for the Monetra ecosystem.\n\t\t\tIt defines core financial types such as Money and Currency, provides arithmetic operations,\n\t\t\tculture-aware formatting, and integration interfaces for extending functionality in subpackages.",
