  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1 - 2026-03-08\n- Added multi-currency symbol support for Currency\n- Added currency names to improve readability and display\n- Added string formatting for Currency objects\n- Added currency constants and Money factory methods for easier construction\n- Improved code generation for constants and factory methods\n- Removed the currency registry, simplifying the Currency structure\n- Removed nullable methods and constructors from the Money class for stricter type safety",
